  "briefing": "Turn 143. You are India (a Hard AI; in the human player's game every AI ran at Normal by mistake): nine cities, 20 soldiers (seven Spearmen, seven Archers, three Pikemen, two Phalangites and an Arquebusier), 13 of them within eight hexes of Chur, and 43 Gold, at war with Switzerland since turn 95. Chur, a population-5 walled Swiss city behind a mountain, stands two to four hexes from the nearest of your units: 200 HP, held by one Arquebusier. The Swiss treasury holds 6,481 Gold. For 21 turns your army stood on fortified tiles around it and attacked nothing. Take Chur by turn 162.",
